"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`） | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 |"

msgid ""
"| GQA | ✅ Full compatibility | ✅ Full compatibility | ✅ Full compatibility |"
" — Not applicable | 🟠 Partial compatibility (Eagle3, eager and "
"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`) | ❌ No compatibility | ❌ No compatibility |"
msgstr ""
"| GQA | ✅ 完全兼容 | ✅ 完全兼容 | ✅ 完全兼容 | — 不适用 | 🟠 部分兼容（Eagle3、eager 和 "
"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`） | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 |"

msgid ""
"| SFA | ✅ Full compatibility | ✅ Full compatibility | ✅ Full compatibility |"
" ❌ No compatibility | ❌ No compatibility | ❌ No compatibility | ❌ No "
"compatibility |"
msgstr "| SFA | ✅ 完全兼容 | ✅ 完全兼容 | ✅ 完全兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 |"

msgid ""
"| DSA | ✅ Full compatibility | ✅ Full compatibility | ✅ Full compatibility |"
" — Not applicable | ❌ No compatibility | ❌ No compatibility | ❌ No "
