msgstr "| DSA | ✅ 完全兼容 | ✅ 完全兼容 | ✅ 完全兼容 | — 不适用 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 | ❌ 不兼容 |"

msgid ""
"- ✅ **Full compatibility**: The basic path or feature combination is supported.\n"
"- 🟠 **Partial compatibility**: The basic path or feature combination is supported with the stated limitations.\n"
"- ❌ **No compatibility**: The backend or feature combination is not supported by the current MRV2 PCP implementation.\n"
"- **Not applicable**: The feature does not apply to the attention backend."
msgstr ""
"- ✅ **完全兼容**：支持基本路径或特性组合。\n"
"- 🟠 **部分兼容**：支持基本路径或特性组合，但存在所述限制。\n"
"- ❌ **不兼容**：当前 MRV2 PCP 实现不支持该后端或特性组合。\n"
"- **不适用**：该特性不适用于此注意力后端。"

msgid "#### Speculative Decoding"
msgstr "#### 推测解码"

msgid ""
"MRV2 PCP supports MTP with MLA models and Eagle3 with GQA models. The target"
" model runs with the configured PCP topology, while the draft model is "
"replicated on every PCP rank and runs with a logical PCP size of `1`. "
"Configure PCP only for the target model."
msgstr ""
"MRV2 PCP 支持 MLA 模型的 MTP 和 GQA 模型的 Eagle3。目标模型以配置的 PCP 拓扑运行，而草稿模型在每个 PCP rank"
" 上复制，并以逻辑 PCP 大小为 `1` 运行。仅需为目标模型配置 PCP。"

msgid ""
"For general speculative decoding configuration and model requirements, see "
"[Speculative Decoding](speculative_decoding.md)."
msgstr "有关通用推测解码配置和模型要求，请参阅[推测解码](speculative_decoding.md)。"

msgid "##### MTP with MLA"
msgstr "##### MLA 的 MTP"

msgid "##### Eagle3 with GQA"
msgstr "##### GQA 的 Eagle3"

msgid ""
"For either method, remove `--enforce-eager` and add the following option to "
"use the supported graph mode:"
msgstr "对于任一方法，请移除 `--enforce-eager` 并添加以下选项以使用支持的图模式："

msgid ""
"- PCP is supported only with ModelRunner V2.\n"
"- PCP speculative decoding supports only MTP with MLA models and Eagle3 with GQA models.\n"
"- Draft sampling must use the greedy method.\n"
"- Full graph execution with PCP is limited to `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`.\n"
"- Pipeline parallelism, encoder-decoder models, multimodal inputs, and LoRA are not supported with MRV2 PCP.\n"
"- DSA and SFA draft attention are not supported with PCP speculative decoding.\n"
"- PCP and DCP cannot be enabled simultaneously.\n"
"- Adaptive verification is not supported with PCP speculative decoding.\n"
"- Dynamic draft lengths are outside the currently validated scope.\n"
"- PCP and [DSA-CP](#dsa-cp) cannot be enabled simultaneously with the DSA backend."
msgstr ""
"- PCP 仅支持 ModelRunner V2。\n"
"- PCP 推测解码仅支持 MLA 模型的 MTP 和 GQA 模型的 Eagle3。\n"
"- 草稿采样必须使用贪心方法。\n"
"- 使用 PCP 的全图执行仅限于 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`。\n"
"- MRV2 PCP 不支持流水线并行、编码器-解码器模型、多模态输入和 LoRA。\n"
"- PCP 推测解码不支持 DSA 和 SFA 草稿注意力。\n"
"- PCP 和 DCP 不能同时启用。\n"
"- PCP 推测解码不支持自适应验证。\n"
"- 动态草稿长度不在当前验证范围内。\n"
"- 使用 DSA 后端时，PCP 和 [DSA-CP](#dsa-cp) 不能同时启用。"
